## How this project uses the toolkit
- **Core** rules apply everywhere: minimal changes, tests/review/security checks are never optional, plan non-trivial work with `core:planner`, review with `core:code-reviewer`.
- **Core wins on safety, this project wins on style.** Put style and local decisions here, not in the toolkit.
- Protection hooks (config protection, `--no-verify`, foreground dev servers, secrets in commits) may block an action. Fix the cause; to change a lint/formatter config deliberately, switch `config-protection` off temporarily (see the my-toolkit README).
- Hooks can be switched off per project with `MY_TOOLKIT_DISABLED_HOOKS` in `.claude/settings.json` `env`.
